CORE
main.cpp
--cpp14
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ eager auto-return under instance map: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
A member function template with an `auto` return type is converted
EAGERLY at the call site (typecheck_method_application) so the return
type is available; that conversion must install the instance's template
map first ([temp.inst]/1) -- the body names the method's own template
parameter (`_Np(21)`).  Kernel of the libc++ ranges pipe reproducer's
first layer.  Runtime-verified g++ 13 / clang++ 18.
